    "custom_trusted_clinicians_showcase_xaxyK9": {
      "type": "custom-trusted-clinicians-showcase",
      "blocks": {
        "clinicians_nWQd9f": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_James_New.png",
            "clinician": "Dr James Morehen",
            "clinician_tagline": "PERFORMANCE NUTRITIONIST, INTERNATIONAL RUGBY",
            "clinician_info": "<p>Performance is not built during training - it is built through recovery. Every adaptation, whether strength, endurance, or resilience, depends on the body's ability to repair and respond to stress. MUTO combines clinically dosed ingredients that support recovery, energy production, and physiological resilience, helping individuals perform at a higher level both in sport and everyday life.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Performance-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Performance"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_JjtU6K": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_Alka_s_New.png",
            "clinician": "Dr Alka Patel",
            "clinician_tagline": "LONGEVITY DOCTOR & GLOBAL SPEAKER",
            "clinician_info": "<p>The body is constantly adapting to the demands placed upon it. Poor sleep, chronic stress, and modern lifestyles can disrupt the biological systems responsible for energy, recovery, and performance. MUTO supports these foundational systems at a cellular level, helping the body respond more effectively to everyday stressors and maintain long-term vitality.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Energy-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Longevity"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_Ta4KJ4": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_Richie_s_New.png",
            "clinician": "Dr Richie Barclay",
            "clinician_tagline": "Molecular Biologist, Nutritionist, Harley St Consultant",
            "clinician_info": "<p>Most health interventions focus on symptoms. True performance starts deeper, at the cellular level. Mitochondria are responsible for producing the energy that powers every movement, thought, and recovery process in the body. MUTO was designed to support these foundational systems through evidence-based ingredients selected to improve resilience, recovery, and cellular function.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Performance-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Performance"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_gpHUN8": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_Matt_s_New.png",
            "clinician": "Dr Maciej Zatonski",
            "clinician_tagline": "PERFORMANCE & SLEEP DOCTOR",
            "clinician_info": "<p>Energy is the currency of human performance. From physical output to cognitive function, every biological process depends on efficient cellular energy production. Supporting metabolic health and mitochondrial function is fundamental to sustaining performance over time. MUTO provides targeted nutritional support for the systems that underpin recovery, energy, and adaptation.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Recovery-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Recovery"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_VnKa7Q": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_Richard_s_New.png",
            "clinician": "Dr Richard Mackenzie",
            "clinician_tagline": "LEADING METABOLISM RESEARCHER",
            "clinician_info": "<p>Stress affects far more than how we feel - it influences recovery, energy production, sleep quality, and overall performance. The ability to adapt to stress is one of the defining characteristics of a healthy system. MUTO combines scientifically researched ingredients that support resilience and recovery, helping the body maintain balance under the demands of modern life.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Energy-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Energy"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_MtWG3k": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Dr_Ash.webp",
            "clinician": "Dr Ash Kapoor",
            "clinician_tagline": "Longevity & Human Optimisation Doctor & Founder of Levitas One",
            "clinician_info": "<p>Energy is not one molecule. It is a whole system. Dr Ash Kapoor focuses on the root causes behind fatigue, metabolic stress and declining resilience. MUTO is built around the same idea: produce cellular energy, protect the systems that sustain it, and put that energy to work across recovery, performance and long-term health.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Energy-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Longevity"
          }
        },
        "clinicians_reQWf8": {
          "type": "clinicians",
          "settings": {
            "clinician_image": "shopify://shop_images/Jamie-Paweleck.jpg",
            "clinician": "Dr Jamie Paweleck",
            "clinician_tagline": "Longevity doctor and medical educator",
            "clinician_info": "<p>In practice you see the same pattern - people doing everything right above the surface and still not recovering as they should. What limits them sits a layer beneath, at cellular level. MUTO supports that system daily, working on the foundations behind energy, repair and recovery.</p>",
            "show_badge": true,
            "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Energy-Icon.svg",
            "badge_label": "Longevity"
          }
        }
      },
