        "description_text_jrpnxQ": {
          "type": "description_text",
          "settings": {
            "description_bullet": "<p><strong>A precision cellular supplement for energy and recovery. Designed for the data on your wrist.</strong></p><p>Your Oura, Whoop, Garmin or Apple Watch measures the output. MUTO is the input: 15 ingredients working as one system to support the cellular energy, repair and protection behind every HRV, recovery and readiness score it shows you.</p>",
