        "custom_liquid_gy4FQd": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"transition-slider\">\n    <p class=\"transition-title\">Your 90-day MUTO journey</p>\n    <div class=\"weekly-transition-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"weekly-transition-box\">\n            <div class=\"transition-icon\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Frame_2147229974.png\" alt=\"Weeks 1-2\">\n                <div class=\"transtion-headings\">\n                    <span class=\"transtion-title\">Weeks 1-2</span>\n                    <span class=\"transtion-subtitle\">The quiet start</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>MUTO starts working from day one - beneath the surface, before your wearable has anything to show. This is the input building.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"weekly-transition-box\">\n            <div class=\"transition-icon\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Frame_2147229974_1.png\"\n                    alt=\"Weeks 3-4\">\n                <div class=\"transtion-headings\">\n                    <span class=\"transtion-title\">Weeks 3-4</span>\n                    <span class=\"transtion-subtitle\">Felt, before it's measured</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>Steadier energy. Fewer crashes. A calmer baseline to train from. The system's compounding - you'll feel it first.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"weekly-transition-box\">\n            <div class=\"transition-icon\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Frame_2147229974_2.png\" alt=\"Month 2\">\n                <div class=\"transtion-headings\">\n                    <span class=\"transtion-title\">Month 2</span>\n                    <span class=\"transtion-subtitle\">HRV starts to tell the story</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>HRV is the honest number - your nervous system reporting on your cells. This is where the system beneath starts to show.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"weekly-transition-box\">\n            <div class=\"transition-icon\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/Frame_2147229974_4.png\" alt=\"Month 3\">\n                <div class=\"transtion-headings\">\n                    <span class=\"transtion-title\">Month 3</span>\n                    <span class=\"transtion-subtitle\">The new baseline, measurable</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"transition-content\">\n                <p>By day 90, it's not just felt - it's on the screen. The standard you hold above starts to show in the system beneath.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_tzKGwG": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What your wearable measures - and what it doesn't",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>HRV. Recovery. Readiness. Sleep quality. Every one of those scores is your cells doing energy work well or badly, converted into a number. MUTO supports how the billions of cells in your body produce that energy - the input behind the output.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_hGympG": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rigorous testing standards",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our products are tested by independent third-party laboratories for heavy metals, microbes, and purity. We have ongoing research collaborations with three research institutions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_LMMXKc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it fits your stack - and when it doesn't",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Most NAD⁺ supplements give you a precursor and stop there. But making NAD⁺ is only the first of three jobs - skip the other two and you're paying to produce NAD⁺ your body loses or never turns into energy you feel.</li><li><strong>Produce</strong> - NR gives your cells the building block they turn into NAD⁺. Essential, but on its own it's one third of the job. It's where NMN and NR stop - and where MUTO starts.</li><li><strong>Protect</strong> - An enzyme (CD38) breaks NAD⁺ down almost as fast as you make it. Quercetin, Pterostilbene, Grapeseed and Turmeric slow that leak, so the NAD⁺ you produce actually sticks around.</li><li><strong>Put to Work</strong> - NAD⁺ in your blood isn't energy yet. CoQ10 and BioPerine® help your cells absorb it and turn it into energy you feel - not just a better number on a lab report.</li><li>Produce without Protect is a leaking tank. Produce without Put to Work is fuel you never burn. NR and NMN do one job. MUTO does all three.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_rLVwhR": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Clinically dosed, bio-available ingredients",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Nicotinamide Riboside (NAD+ precursor), quercetin, grapeseed and turmeric extracts, pterostilbene and CoQ10 - with a complete B complex including methylated folate and B12, plus D3, K2, zinc, copper and BioPerine® for absorption.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_mKe3zd": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to take it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take two capsules daily with your first meal. Most report a difference between weeks three and six. A daily system that builds a stronger baseline.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_cPYHcB": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery, subscription and guarantee",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Free UK next-day delivery. Skip, pause or cancel anytime. 90-day money-back guarantee, <a href=\"/pages/terms-and-conditions\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Terms and conditions\">click here to learn more</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
